{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/sunrise-bay-emaar-beach-front","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":447,"crm_id":"1089","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Sunrise Bay","slug":"sunrise-bay-emaar-beach-front","display_address":"EMAAR BeachFront","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":6250000,"display_price":"6.2M","lattitude":25.0974461,"longitude":55.1401795,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Sunrise Bay is a coastal residential complex consisting of two 26-storey buildings. The project consists of two completely identical towers connected by a five-storey podium, inside which are located shopping center, stores, restaurants and recreation area with a swimming pool.</p><p>The complex offers stylish apartments with<strong> 1-4 bedrooms</strong>, which offer spectacular views of the Arabian Gulf or the marina. The layouts of the residences are spacious and functional, the interior is made in loft style, there is a fully equipped kitchen, spacious bathroom, built-in closet, laundry room, open balcony, panoramic windows. Apartments with 2-4 bedrooms are complemented by walk-in closets.</p><p>Residents have access to premium amenities: private beach, underground parking, 24-hour security, panoramic infinity pool, children's play area, equipped gym.</p><p>The infrastructure of this neighborhood is carefully planned for permanent residence and convenient business. It will take less than 5 minutes by car to reach Dubai Marina. Within 10-15 minutes drive are Berlitz Private School, Raffles Nursery School, Marina Medical Center, Drs. Nicolas &amp; Asp. Residents have access to public transportation: monorail, buses and streetcars. A quick exit to Sheikh Zayed Road provides easy access to the main locations of Dubai.</p>","til